  dscresource), Manual (2 rules, produces nothing) and Document (3 rules, produces nothing) - all
  three already proven by prior maps, so this fixture is a survey rather than new generator work.
  V-235720 is an ordinary RegistryPolicyFile rule; V-235766 is a real Registry rule whose value
  the organisation decides, and unlike Chrome's equivalent the real org.default.xml already
  answers it rather than leaving the ValueData blank; V-279940 is the Registry dscresource
